71-25/491820141_1421287382886425_3295820239406517661_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ht2wjAPmYdEQ7kNvwGpTNQ1&_nc_oc=Adr4W41mUO3IvBZwF89yxvKCwp-NxbSSTDo2TmXwIdYtO0T8gPgVGAzen3oCWDPEU80&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRjBCp-RjwPvzUVounWtKg5cPQMFRfWRD6uM1Ivp_CkFw&oe=6AF7497D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Periodic Table VR", "keywords": ["chemistry", "science", "stem", "education", "learning"], "long_description": "Periodic Table VR - By Blekol Games\n\nStep inside the elements like never before.\n\nPeriodic Table VR transforms chemistry into an immersive, interactive experience designed for Meta Quest. Explore elements in full 3D, interact with atomic structures, and learn through presence, not memorization.\nMeet Atlas \u2013 Now Smarter Than Ever (v3.4)\n\nAtlas has received a major voice upgrade.\n\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f 1200+ unique in-game phrases\n\ud83d\udd0a More natural and dynamic speech delivery\n\ud83e\udde9 Context-aware responses during exploration\n\n\ud83c\udfae Stronger immersion and personality\nAtlas now reacts more fluidly to your actions, making the learning experience feel alive and responsive.\n\n\ud83d\udd2c What You Can Do\nExplore the full periodic table in VR\nInteract with detailed atomic models\nLearn properties, groups, and real-world uses\nExperience guided discovery with Atlas\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Version 3.4 Improvements\nMajor Atlas speaking expansion\nVoice interaction enhancements\nPerformance optimizations\nStability improvements\n\n", "short_description": "Periodic Table VR \nVersion 3.4 Update\n-Atlas Upgrade\n\nAtlas just got smarter!\nNow featuring 1200+ unique voice phrases, delivering richer, more dynamic interactions throughout your VR learning experience.\n\nImproved immersion, smarter responses, and overall performance enhancements.\n\n\u2014 Blekol Games \ud83d\ude80"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https:/